### ============================================================================
### User Map API - Example Requests
### Endpoint: GET /api/v1/users/map
### 
### These examples use the mock data with 100,000 users in Moscow and Vladivostok
### ============================================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================================================
### 1. Query by Bounds (Bounding Box) - Moscow
### Format: minLat,minLng,maxLat,maxLng
### ============================================================================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Query by Bounds - Vladivostok
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=43.0,131.7,43.3,132.0&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Query by Bounds - Smaller area in Moscow (city center)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.7,37.5,55.8,37.7&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Query by Bounds - Smaller area in Vladivostok (city center)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=43.1,131.8,43.2,131.9&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 2. Query by Center Point and Radius - Moscow
### Format: lat,lng,radiusMeters
### ============================================================================

### Moscow city center (Red Square area) - 5km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?center=55.7558,37.6173,5000&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Moscow city center - 10km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?center=55.7558,37.6173,10000&limit=200&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Vladivostok city center - 5km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?center=43.1056,131.8735,5000&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Vladivostok city center - 10km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?center=43.1056,131.8735,10000&limit=200&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 3. Query by Nearby (Same as center, alternative parameter name)
### Format: lat,lng,radiusMeters
### ============================================================================

### Nearby Moscow city center - 2km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?nearby=55.7558,37.6173,2000&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Nearby Vladivostok city center - 2km radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?nearby=43.1056,131.8735,2000&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 4. Query by Country and City
### ============================================================================

### All users in Moscow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?country=Russia&city=Moscow&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### All users in Vladivostok
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?country=Russia&city=Vladivostok&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### All users in Russia (both cities)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?country=Russia&limit=200&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 5. Pagination Examples
### ============================================================================

### First page - Moscow (first 100 users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Second page - Moscow (next 100 users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Third page - Moscow (next 100 users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=200
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 6. Different Limit Values
### ============================================================================

### Small limit - 10 users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Medium limit - 50 users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Large limit - 500 users (maximum)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=500&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 7. Specific Area Queries (for testing different regions)
### ============================================================================

### Northern part of Moscow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.8,37.3,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Southern part of Moscow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,55.7,37.9&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Eastern part of Moscow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.6,56.0,37.9&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Western part of Moscow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.6&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### 8. Combined Queries (using default values)
### ============================================================================

### Query with default limit (100) and offset (0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?bounds=55.5,37.3,56.0,37.9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Query by city with defaults
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/map?city=Moscow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================================================================
### Notes:
### 
### 1. All requests require JWT authentication via Authorization header
### 2. Rate limit: 100 requests per minute per user/IP
### 3. Maximum limit: 500 users per request
### 4. Default limit: 100 users
### 5. Default offset: 0
### 
### Coordinate Reference:
### - Moscow: Latitude 55.5-56.0, Longitude 37.3-37.9
### - Vladivostok: Latitude 43.0-43.3, Longitude 131.7-132.0
### 
### Mock Data:
### - 50,000 users in Moscow (user_id 1-50000)
### - 50,000 users in Vladivostok (user_id 50001-100000)
### - 70% have location_sharing_enabled = true
### - Privacy levels: 40% exact, 30% city, 20% country, 10% private
### ============================================================================

